  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian House of Representatives (DPR RI) is currently prioritizing several legislative agendas aimed at regulatory reform. Lawmakers are focusing on the Wiretapping Bill, which is being fast-tracked in response to reports regarding illegal surveillance. Concurrently, the House has approved the Bill on the Procedures for Law Formation as an initiative, which establishes formal mechanisms for rapid legislative drafting. In addition to these administrative reforms, discussions are underway regarding the modernization of public service laws, including the Population Administration Bill. Furthermore, members of Commission I have proposed that a dedicated bill on Artificial Intelligence be incorporated into the 2027 mid-term national legislation program. These developments reflect an ongoing effort by the legislature to refine existing legal frameworks while addressing emerging technological and security challenges through structured public consultation and parliamentary deliberation.",
